{{ru-noun-table|e|Бог|nom_sg=Бог//Box|voc=Бо́же|n=sg|a=an}}

====Usage notes====
* God is addressed (vocative: Боже) with the informal {{term|lang=ru|ты}}, not the formal {{term|lang=ru|вы}}, and verb imperatives in singular ({{term|lang=ru|дай}}, {{term|lang=ru|сохрани}}, {{term|lang=ru|храни}}).

